  "prefLabel": "Lot 702.01 Employee Recognition Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 702.01 Employee Recognition Program. The purpose of this part is to develop and implement an employee recognition program for monetary incentives to promote increased sales and compensate lottery sales representatives based upon performance, as authorized by RSA 248:21-h, VII.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Lot 700) #13419, eff 7-27-22",
